  "text": "Emergency Vet in West Caldwell, NJ | Animal Emergency & Referral Associates (AERA)\nSkip to Primary Content\nContact Us\nContact Us\nMap\n975 Bloomfield Ave.,\nWest Caldwell,\nNJ,\n07006\nCall\n(973) 788-0500\n24/7 Emergency Care\n24/7 Emergency Care\nPhone:\n(973) 788-0500\nAddress:\n975 Bloomfield Ave.,\nWest Caldwell,\nNJ,\n07006\nBlog\nOnline Pharmacy\nAbout Us\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nServices\n24/7 Emergency\nAnesthesia\nDiagnostics and Radiology\nInternal Medicine\nOrthopedic and Soft Tissue Surgery\nRadiation Oncology\nView All Services\nPet Owners\nFor Veterinarians\nCareers\n24/7 Emergency Care\nContact Us\nAnimal Emergency & Referral Associates\nPart of your pet’s healthcare team\nPROVIDING EXCEPTIONAL CARE TO THE WEST CALDWELL, NJ COMMUNITY SINCE 1977\nThe growth of AERA is a testimony to the quality of care, dedication, and compassion of our doctors, nurses, and client service representatives who are the lifeblood of our mission—to provide outstanding emergency and specialty care for our beloved animal companions. You can rest easy knowing that your pet is in the most capable hands at AERA.\nCareers at AERA\n24/7 Emergency Care\nView All Services\nCareers at AERA\n24/7 Emergency Care\nView All Services\nCareers at AERA\n24/7 Emergency Care\nView All Services\nCareers at AERA\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(973) 788-0500\nFax:\n(973) 364-0004\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nSpecialty Care is available Monday - Friday from 7:30 - 5:00 pm by appointment only.\nWho We Are\nAt AERA, we understand that pets are members of the family. We truly believe that because of this, they should be awarded the same quality of compassionate medical care that we expect for our human family members.\nOur doctors and medical staff always strive to exceed expectations and perform care that utilizes the most up-to-date and advanced innovations in veterinary medicine.\nAs a referral emergency veterinary hospital, we work closely with your family veterinarian to provide your pet with a complete healthcare team. We serve West Caldwell, Verona, Cedar Grove, Clifton, Montclair, Livingston, Wayne, Fairfield, and surrounding communities.\nClient Reviews & Testimonials\nAnimal Emergency & Referral Associates have been dedicated to providing quality veterinary care to the West Caldwell, NJ community since 1977. We strive to treat your pets with the same care and compassion as if they were our own.\nAnimal Emergency & Referral Associates\n975 Bloomfield Ave.\nWest Caldwell\n,\nNJ\n07006\nT:\n(973) 788-0500\nF:\n(973) 364-0004\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nSpecialty Care is available Monday - Friday from 7:30 - 5:00 pm by appointment only.\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nServices\nClient Resources\nFor Veterinarians\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nCareers\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
